# oracle: fix bond/react CreateIDs (created atoms, modify_create fit create_fit overlap 2.0, max_rxn 30), polystyrene trimer growing a styrene chain (examples/PACKAGES/reaction/create_atoms_polystyrene) cut to 30 steps (the example runs 8000): one reaction (step 21) creates 16 atoms; from there the nvt on the statted group (reassigned after the reaction) differs from native at 1e-9 relative, growing to 1e-5 by step 60 (open item in src/engine/fix/nh.ts)
# oracle-inputs: w94react_create_trimer.data w94react_create.map w94react_create_pre.molecule_template w94react_create_post.molecule_template
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all abs=1e-9
# Measured max relative error, engine vs native (thermo rows, final atoms): thermo 4.1e-15, atoms 3.3e-13 (Node 24; the reaction at step 21 places the 16 created atoms at native's positions, velocities and forces).
units real
boundary p p p
atom_style full
pair_style lj/class2/coul/cut 8.5
angle_style class2
bond_style class2
dihedral_style class2
improper_style class2
special_bonds lj/coul 0 0 1
pair_modify tail yes mix sixthpower
read_data w94react_create_trimer.data extra/bond/per/atom 5 extra/angle/per/atom 15 extra/dihedral/per/atom 15 extra/improper/per/atom 25 extra/special/per/atom 25
molecule mol1 w94react_create_pre.molecule_template
molecule mol2 w94react_create_post.molecule_template
thermo 10
fix myrxns all bond/react stabilization yes statted_grp .03 max_rxn rxn1 30 react rxn1 all 1 0 3.0 mol1 mol2 w94react_create.map modify_create fit create_fit overlap 2.0 stabilize_steps 200
fix 1 statted_grp_REACT nvt temp 530 530 100
fix 4 bond_react_MASTER_group temp/rescale 1 530 530 1 1
thermo_style custom step temp press density f_myrxns[1]
thermo_modify colname auto format float %.15g
run 30
